[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.5, voice=res://zooLevels/afterGnomes/sorry you got shot out of the sky.wav, next=auto] Yeah, sorry you got shot out of the sky. Are you okay? [#voice=uid://clr3qnbk281bk]
[color=#7ece73]Mothman[/color]: [speed=0.4, voice=res://zooLevels/afterGnomes/MothmanLine3.wav, next=auto] [shake rate=20 level=10] Tis but a flesh wound, young one. [/shake][#voice=uid://gxq5ouckxaf]
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.5, voice=res://zooLevels/afterGnomes/idk what that means.wav, next=auto] I don't know what that means, but you should rest. I'll come with you. I need a nap after that whole thing. [#voice=uid://uh23vfhqnhjx]
