[color=grey]Old Man[/color]: [speed=0.4, voice=res://zooLevels/afterGnomes/I’m afraid not.wav, next=auto] I'm afraid not, and this one is important! The Loch Ness monster has resurfaced! [#voice=uid://cn21b32gxei2o]
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.5, voice=res://zooLevels/afterGnomes/come on old man.wav, next=auto] Come one, Old Man, there's not way I can relax for just a little bit? [#voice=uid://b81sqcg2ehyl6]
[color=grey]Old Man[/color]: [speed=0.4, voice=res://zooLevels/afterGnomes/Mmmm fine.wav, next=auto] Hmmm... fine. Go take a nap, but make sure you get to me by dusk! [#voice=uid://dvh0r0vixu3sq]
